ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":16,"end":30,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","静默之刺"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/kr","침묵의 가시"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","奥菲戈斯将音叉刺入目标体内，引发共鸣爆炸并击倒目标周围的敌人。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/kr","실피라가 튜닝포크로 목표를 찔러, 공명 폭발을 일으키고 목표 주변 적군을 넘어뜨린다."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","使用音叉刺入敌人体内，造成短暂控制效果和200% + 20% ATK伤害，随后将音律注入音叉引发【断奏】，对目标及周围1格的所有敌人造成320% + 40% ATK伤害并将其击倒2秒，奥菲戈斯在释放该技能时免疫控制效果。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","튜닝포크로 적군을 찔러 짧은 제어 효과를 부여하며 200% + 20% ATK의 대미지를 입힌다. 이후 음률을 튜닝포크에 주입해 [스타카토]로 목표와 그 주변 1칸의 모든 적군에게 320% + 40% ATK의 대미지를 입히며 2초 동안 넘어뜨린다. 해당 스킬 시전 중 실피라는 제어 면역 상태가 된다."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":72,"end":78,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":32,"end":38,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":104,"end":110,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":68,"end":82,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":28,"end":42,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":100,"end":114,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","【断奏】伤害提升至340% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","[스타카토] 대미지가 340% + 40% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":12,"end":26